cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or reference its design in your own work,
  please cite it as below.
type: software
title: SEC EDGAR Extraction Pipeline
authors:
  - given-names: Austin
    family-names: Kuo
    alias: A-Kuo
repository-code: "https://github.com/A-Kuo/sec-edgar-extraction-pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A data engineering pipeline that ingests SEC 10-K/10-Q filings, extracts
  structured financial facts from XBRL, validates data quality (completeness
  and PSI drift detection), persists idempotently to PostgreSQL with an
  append-only audit trail, serves results through a Redis-cached FastAPI
  layer, and answers citation-grounded questions over filing text via a
  deterministic TF-IDF retrieval layer.
keywords:
  - data-engineering
  - etl
  - airflow
  - sec-edgar
  - xbrl
  - fastapi
  - data-quality
  - retrieval-augmented-generation
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-05-15"
